{"id":"2c220269e5cc522a","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system.md","title":"ZFC Forcing12 Fusion System","display":"df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system — ZFC Forcing12 Fusion System","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system — ZFC Forcing12 Fusion System","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing12-fusion-system — ZFC Forcing12 Fusion System"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,\\leq,P\\in V\">\\(F,\\leq,P\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(n)\">\\(F(n)\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>-th fusion refinement.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12FusionSystem}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12FusionSystem}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}fusion\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12FusionSystem}_S(F,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal P(P\\times P))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(F(n+1)\\subseteq F(n)\\cap\\leq)\\land\n\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,P)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\langle s(n+1),s(n)\\rangle\\in F(n)\\bigr]\\Bigr]\n\\to \\exists q\\in P\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\langle q,s(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing12\\text{-}fusion\\text{-}system} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing12FusionSystem}_S(F,P,\\leq)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(F,\\omega,\\mathcal P(P\\times P))\\land\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(F(n+1)\\subseteq F(n)\\cap\\leq)\\land\n\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[\\mathrm{Function}(s,\\omega,P)\\land\n\\bigl[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\langle s(n+1),s(n)\\rangle\\in F(n)\\bigr]\\Bigr]\n\\to \\exists q\\in P\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\langle q,s(n)\\rangle\\in\\leq\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Besides nested refinements, the definition includes the fusion axiom: every fusion sequence has a common lower bound in the declared order relation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathcal P$ are as in [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Poset}$, $\\mathrm{Function}$, and $\\mathcal P$ are as in [[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]], [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], and [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]].","emb